# ZeloxTag

Hybrid Hardware/SaaS: laser-engraved stainless QR tags on cars → digital vehicle document & history dashboard (ABEs, TÜV, invoices). Physical Web, mobile-first, outdoor scan UX.

## Stack
- Next.js App Router + TypeScript (Server Components by default)
- Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, Lucide
- Supabase: Postgres, RLS, Storage, Magic Link/Email Auth
- Deploy: Vercel

## Domain model
- `users` (Supabase Auth)
- `vehicles` (id, user_id, make, model, year, vin, created_at)
- `tags` (id, uuid, vehicle_id, status: unclaimed | active, created_at)
- `documents` (id, vehicle_id, title, type: abe | invoice | tuev | other, file_url, amount, date)

## Routes & flows
- QR entry: `/v/[uuid]`
- `unclaimed` → auth + vehicle claim → link tag, set `active`
- `active` → dashboard; owner R/W, third party read-only via RLS

## Engineering rules
- Production-ready, readable, strictly typed, DRY, modular, futureproof
- Client components only when interactivity requires it
- Mobile-first: contrast, large tap targets, fast
- Never bypass RLS; scope data access correctly
- Proper loading/error fallbacks; no messy inline logic
